# Playwright Commands
Inside that directory, you can run several commands:

# Runs the end-to-end tests
  npx playwright test
    
# Starts the interactive UI mode
  npx playwright test --ui
    

# Runs the tests only on Desktop Chrome
  npx playwright test --project=chromium
    
# Runs the tests in a specific file
  npx playwright test <filename>

# Runs the tests in debug mode | opens a separate debug window    
  npx playwright test --debug
    

# Auto generate tests with Codegen
  npx playwright codegen
    
# runs the  example.spec.ts in headless mode by default
  npx playwright test <name of file to run> //npx = command is used to run the command 
    
# runs the single testfile in headed mode
  npx playwright test example.spec.ts --headed
    
# runs all the tests/testfile in headed mode
  npx playwright test --headed  


